OL,3,AOslo mayor calls off wedding ceremony
OL,4,Aafter death of Norway's king
OL,5,
OL,6,FOslo's Mayor Anne Lindboe has called
OL,7,Foff her wedding ceremony because of the
OL,8,Fdeath of King Harald V of Norway.
OL,10,FThe wedding with her fiance Pal Sandvid
OL,11,Fwas planned to take place on Friday but
OL,12,Fwas postponed after the king died
OL,13,Fearlier the same day, her political
OL,14,Fadviser confirmed to the BBC.
OL,16,F"It's hard to imagine an Oslo and a
OL,17,FNorway without you. You didn't need a
OL,18,Fcrown to be king," Lindboe wrote in a
OL,19,Ftribute to the late monarch on
OL,20,FInstagram.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
