OL,3,ARussia ramps up rhetoric but wants to
OL,4,Aavoid war with Nato, Western officials
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussian President Vladimir Putin wants
OL,8,Fto avoid a direct military
OL,9,Fconfrontation with Nato, despite
OL,10,Fincreasingly hostile rhetoric aimed at
OL,11,Fthe UK and other allies over their
OL,12,Fsupport for Ukraine, Western officials
OL,13,Fbelieve.
OL,15,FSome reports have suggested the visit
OL,16,Fby CIA chief John Radcliffe to Moscow
OL,17,Fthis week was, in part, to warn Russia
OL,18,Fagainst a possible attack on a member
OL,19,Fof the Euro-Atlantic military alliance.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
