OL,3,ARussia ramps up rhetoric but wants to
OL,4,Aavoid war with Nato, Western officials
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the Western officials, who asked
OL,8,Fnot to be named, said recent warnings
OL,9,Ffrom Moscow, including that UK forces
OL,10,Fcould be targeted in future or that its
OL,11,Fweapons factories could be hit, were
OL,12,F"nothing new".
OL,14,FThey were, they suggested, consistent
OL,15,Fwith Russia's military doctrine to
OL,16,Fapply pressure on the West.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
